    "title": "NFL player fined $15k for using 'offensive' drinking celebration - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jason Gunn ,\n1 days ago Fullback Kyle Juszczyk was fined $14,926, saying he violated Rule 12, Section 3, Article 1, in an \"offensive\" touchdown celebration. Juszczyk, a Harvard University graduate, typically goes by the nickname \"Juice,\" a phonetic play on his last name, said \"I don’t even drink beer.\" A source familiar with the... Read full article",
